  "citation": "Arora B; Venkatesh S; Dwivedi D; Vezhapperambu S; Ramesh M (2022): Water Quality Parameters at the Elkhorn Slough National Estuarine Research Reserve (ESNERR). Linking Nutrient Reactivity and Transport in Subsurface Flowpaths Along a Terrestrial-Estuarine Continuum. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1875297",
  "dataset": {
